WEBVTT

00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:07.220
Born as a man, he is the strongest man on earth who dreams once in a lifetime.

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:13.220
A grappler is a fighter who aims to be the strongest man on earth.

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:12.670
Listen, there's only one enemy.

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:15.390
But he's not an ordinary kid!

00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:17.510
He's just a little kid!

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:28.550
It's just like the rumors, Kido-san.

00:02:28.550 --> 00:02:30.000
But...

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.550
Hey, what do you mean?

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:33.930
Are you saying that some kid is trying to get away with something?

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:37.930
Shinmai is keeping his mouth shut.

00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:40.400
You guys, I'm going to take Baki's ball!

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:42.830
Yes!

00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:44.930
It's a mess.

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:46.610
Mr. Naito!

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:50.470
Mr. Naito!

00:02:50.470 --> 00:02:52.440
Thank you for coming!

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:53.670
What?

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:56.150
What's the big deal about killing one kid?

00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:57.360
This is a mess.

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:05.350
Naito-san, I'm sorry. Please don't say anything today and just follow me! I'm begging you!

00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:08.810
Why are you so scared, Kitazawa?

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:10.530
I'm begging you, Naito-san!

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:13.060
Kitazawa-san! Kitazawa-san!

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:15.080
You're here!

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:41.890
I'm all alone. I'm so mad! I really came here all alone!

00:03:41.890 --> 00:03:43.640
You idiot!

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:46.550
What's wrong? Are you scared?

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:49.400
To a kid like you...

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:58.100
Huh?

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:26.760
I will not spare you.

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:32.200
Idiot!

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:41.000
I did it in a blink of an eye.

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:46.130
You know the truth of the person who has a knife.

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:47.950
The problem is from here.

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:51.760
Half of you are scared, but the other half is not.

00:04:53.090 --> 00:04:55.290
Don't talk nonsense!

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:57.820
There are 100 people here.

00:04:57.820 --> 00:04:59.920
The game starts from here.

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:04.150
What is it? Don't laugh!

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:05.310
It's four of us.

00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:07.010
What? I can't hear you!

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:10.430
It's four of us for me.

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:11.640
Four of us?

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:13.090
Four of us?

00:05:13.090 --> 00:05:14.530
What do you mean?

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:24.320
What?

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:26.600
We're going to have a proper fight!

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:27.520
You idiot!

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:28.350
It's too strong!

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:29.460
Hang in there!

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:32.340
Idiot!

00:05:34.820 --> 00:05:35.820
He's my comrade!

00:05:35.820 --> 00:05:36.820
Comrade!

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:37.820
You fool!

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:38.820
You really did it!

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:42.060
Four of us have to jump at the same time.

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:42.960
I thought about it.

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:44.380
But Kido-san...

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:46.270
There are a hundred of them.

00:05:46.270 --> 00:05:48.760
It's not half and half.

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:51.360
Kido-san!

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:53.240
What?

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:54.090
What?

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:58.360
What?

00:06:59.050 --> 00:07:00.000
Are you sure you want to go this far?

00:07:00.410 --> 00:07:02.890
I don't want to get in any more trouble.

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:04.100
Kido-san!

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:20.860
That's enough.

00:07:20.860 --> 00:07:29.940
What are you doing there?

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:32.230
No! It's Kido!

00:07:32.230 --> 00:07:33.230
Run away! Hurry up!

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:40.050
It's not the time for a kid to wake up. Go home and get some sleep!

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:42.640
Are you sure you want me to go home?

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:47.140
Hey, you monster.

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:55.060
Kido-san!

00:07:57.110 --> 00:07:58.110
Huh? Old man?

00:07:58.110 --> 00:07:59.070
Kido-san!

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:00.000
You!

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:10.310
I'm going to beat you to death!

00:08:10.310 --> 00:08:12.720
This is the fifth one.

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:14.530
You want to lose again?

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:16.150
I won't let you do that.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:21.100
Kido-san...

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:23.200
It's okay.

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:26.270
Baki, you lost.

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:29.000
I beat you down, Sousa.

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.000
About...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.380
37 people.

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:33.080
Yes.

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:36.460
Out of 100 people, 37 people were killed.

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:40.210
Yes, but the police were in the middle of it.

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:45.700
That's enough, look for the next one.

00:08:45.700 --> 00:08:54.130
Losing is losing, Baki.

00:08:54.130 --> 00:09:00.000
Hehe.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:03.050
Oh, 37 people.

00:09:03.050 --> 00:09:08.450
I thought I could handle more than 50 people.

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:24.360
Are you sure? Leave it alone.

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:26.070
That's an obstacle.

00:09:26.070 --> 00:09:28.290
Do you want to cut your teeth too?

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:29.250
No...

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:32.420
Don't follow me.

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:33.850
No, I won't.

00:09:33.850 --> 00:09:38.040
Those guys might still be wandering around.

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:43.160
Besides, I have to teach this guy who joined the boy group today about you.

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:45.050
This is also a job.

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:48.870
Take it.

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:51.160
You're strong.

00:09:51.160 --> 00:09:52.620
I'm not strong.

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:53.220
Oh.

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:56.860
Baki is feared by the bad guys in the city.

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:58.810
How much?

00:09:58.810 --> 00:10:00.000
Well, if you look at it,

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:06.660
That was fast.

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:16.910
What the hell is this?

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:18.940
I can't even reach out to him.

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:21.340
How could he do this?

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:24.700
This is all they can do.

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:27.740
But this is a nuisance to the neighborhood.

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:29.880
His parents are short.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.220
Well, he lives on his own.

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:35.100
Huh? Then...

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:37.680
No, I heard he has parents.

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:39.710
You're being so noisy.

00:10:39.710 --> 00:10:41.460
Sorry.

00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:43.410
Just pick that up.

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:52.760
You get it, don't you? He's Hanma Baki.

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:58.000
Even though this town is full of violence, his name will always be on the list.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:00.000
I'm afraid of bad guys, but...

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.920
I was 13 years old.

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:04.130
I was in junior high school for a year.

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:24.070
Junior high school for a year?

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:26.080
It won't even take a minute for you to graduate.

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:34.620
Like a weapon.

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:35.680
No.

00:11:35.680 --> 00:11:39.640
I can't go to the world like my father.

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:21.950
I've been waiting for you.

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:25.140
You must be injured.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:27.070
It's not a big deal.

00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:30.000
I don't really want to say it, but the fight is over.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:33.200
I'm not sure. If you're aiming for the first rank, it's even more...

00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:34.300
Shut up!

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:36.270
Excuse me.

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:40.600
Well then, let's begin today's program.

00:12:40.600 --> 00:13:00.000
Strongly!

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:07.590
If I don't become stronger, I won't be able to catch up with my father!

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:11.240
Yes, that's fine.

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:17.930
Now, let's get ready to breathe and move on to the next menu.

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:18.900
That's enough.

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:21.070
Huh? What did you say just now?

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:25.990
I'm telling you, you guys are done!

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:27.340
What are you talking about?

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:30.000
If we do as we're told, we'll definitely be the first!

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:31.360
A first-class fighter?

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:32.360
Shut up!

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:35.010
What do you mean, "first-class"?

00:13:38.220 --> 00:13:39.180
Baki-sama!

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:42.740
No matter how much you do this,

00:13:42.740 --> 00:13:45.290
you can't get any stronger!

00:13:45.290 --> 00:13:47.020
Baki-sama, please stop!

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:48.020
It's a sword!

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:50.020
You can't do this!

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:51.340
Bastard!

00:13:51.340 --> 00:13:52.880
Bastard!

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:54.100
Bastard!

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:56.910
You can't beat me!

00:13:56.910 --> 00:13:58.900
No matter how much you do this, it doesn't make any sense!

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:07.650
I'm not going to let you control me!

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:09.830
I'll do it my way!

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:21.760
Got it?

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:22.760
This is Akezawa.

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:25.860
Ah, Kochi?

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:27.300
Eh? Baki-sama?

00:14:37.420 --> 00:14:39.080
It was worth it, wasn't it?

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:41.290
That girl, too.

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:43.410
The promise of one million yen.

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:45.010
Please take it.

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:46.770
Hey, Mr. Kuriyagawa.

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:50.320
This one-million-yen pot doesn't suit you.

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:56.590
We were about to become the head of the family.

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:57.640
Mr. Kitazawa.

00:14:57.640 --> 00:15:00.000
I asked you to take Hama Baki

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:03.970
you will have to pay 1,000,000 yen as a reward for defeating Touhou.

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:05.870
You have accepted that.

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:07.080
What's that got to do with it?

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:12.930
I believe that your physical damage caused by this has nothing to do with Touhou.

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:16.930
Oh, I see. If you don't like it, why don't you work for your company?

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:21.970
I heard that you were asked to attack a 13-year-old boy.

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:25.030
Hey! Say something!

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:28.310
Please be quiet, customer!

00:15:28.310 --> 00:15:29.830
Shut up! Don't mess with me!

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:39.200
*Gasp*

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:43.590
*Gasp*

00:15:43.590 --> 00:15:44.870
*Gasp*

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:46.320
It's not good to be a sword.

00:15:46.320 --> 00:15:48.550
*Gasp*

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:49.550
Did it come?

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:50.290
*Gasp*

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:50.790
No.

00:15:50.790 --> 00:15:52.870
Everyone makes mistakes.

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:20.810
I want to become stronger, and I want to become the strongest grappler like my father.

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:23.350
But I can't just leave it like this.

00:16:23.350 --> 00:16:30.000
If I don't leave it like this, what should I do?

00:16:30.190 --> 00:16:30.930
Mawari!

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:05.580
That guy...

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:08.540
The strongest Gokudo in the world?

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:12.540
What are you going to do if the Akezawa Group in the world finds out about this?

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:16.900
First of all, do you think there are tens of thousands of Gokudo in the whole country?

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:19.420
I'm 100% aware that you're out of your mind.

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:26.770
Even if you're already out of your mind, I'd like you to tell the teacher who was told that this person existed in Japan.

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:30.000
Well, even if you've changed the world,

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:35.000
The world is a business of the spirit. Don't be fooled by the good fight.

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:42.190
In any world, there are one or two geniuses.

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:46.550
It's not an exception to fight.

00:18:09.280 --> 00:18:14.140
Well, if it's a piece of trash, it's Hanayama.

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:19.960
Hanayama?

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:21.010
What's that?

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:23.860
Go, go, Deino! I'll show you your knees!

00:18:23.860 --> 00:18:25.240
Gah!

00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:28.510
Gah!

00:18:28.510 --> 00:18:29.560
Gah!

00:18:29.560 --> 00:18:30.000
Gah!

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:47.390
Uwa!

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:47.800
Ah!

00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:49.090
Urgh!

00:18:49.090 --> 00:18:50.090
Are you okay, Dino!?

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:53.710
Are you here to see me?

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:54.710
You're a junior high school student.

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:55.890
Why...

00:18:55.890 --> 00:18:57.870
are you doing Muay Thai and boxing?

00:18:57.870 --> 00:18:58.890
It's amazing, isn't it?

00:18:58.890 --> 00:18:59.730
He's not here.

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:03.600
Yuri Tchaikovsky, World Welterweight Champion.

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:06.080
Yuri Tchaikovsky?

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:13.110
Yuri is a great boxer who looks up to the world of Welterweight and aims to win 6 times at the same time.

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:17.840
Well, he doesn't stop sparring with those guys.

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:22.870
So, he's been sparring with them by calling them to the Meitai Champ.

00:19:22.870 --> 00:19:29.540
Alright, I got you! I won't let you get away with this!

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:39.330
Kaoru Hanayama, the head of the Hanayama Industry Group.

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:47.070
He's still a weakling, but he's the second in line after his predecessor, Hanayama, left.

00:19:47.070 --> 00:19:53.980
When his predecessor was taken away, the Hanayama Group launched a comrade-to-comrade battle against the Tomizawa Group in Kobe.

00:19:53.980 --> 00:20:00.000
The Hanayama Group was a 50-member armed group of the Tomizawa Group.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:03.380
He went crazy with Marugoshi.

00:20:03.380 --> 00:20:12.180
Marugoshi?

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:13.680
It's 30 minutes.

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:19.330
A 15-year-old kid was able to destroy one group of people in 30 minutes.

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:22.350
A 15-year-old kid?

00:20:22.350 --> 00:20:27.970
When Hanayama came to play two years ago, he played a prank on him.

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.000
Hanayama Kaoru.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.020
He's a genius!

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:37.040
Get out of here!

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:45.040
What a short upper!

00:20:45.040 --> 00:20:48.930
I couldn't move my body.

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:55.350
He's fast.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:02.720
You're done for.

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:09.640
You're done for.

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:11.750
He won't come out.

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:13.780
He won't come out.

00:21:13.780 --> 00:21:19.310
Good job, Yuuri.

00:21:19.310 --> 00:21:21.420
Let's move on to the next program.

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:23.530
Let's move on to the next program.

00:21:23.530 --> 00:21:27.370
What's wrong with that boy?

00:21:27.370 --> 00:21:29.380
What's wrong with that boy?

00:21:31.240 --> 00:21:33.010
Oh, you're good at this!

00:21:33.010 --> 00:21:51.220
Right, Free Chako Futsuki?

00:21:51.220 --> 00:21:58.130
Let's do some sparring!

00:23:52.520 --> 00:24:00.000
I want to be strong, and I was born to be strong, aiming for a big back that stands tall.

00:24:01.310 --> 00:24:06.070
The boy opened the curtain of battle with his own will.

00:24:06.070 --> 00:24:12.640
The boy's awakening moved the darkness behind him, and violent fangs rose.
